[h1]Update notes: ːsteamhappyː[/h1]
[olist]
[*]Mac OSX Support;
[*]The "Online" option was removed due to several complaints that it was "deceitful", but we're still figuring out the online mode (don't lose hope!);
Some icons were added to the "Party Selection", now each party has its own icon, we received some complaints that the screen looked a little bit off the way it was;

[*]"Tips" were added to the loading screen (we thought that players might find them useful );

[*]The former "Challenge" mode now is called "Spy Academy", since we had only implemented some of the early stage "challenges" they weren't really much of a challenge to anyone. We also changed the way the "Lessons" are shown;

[*]A Cat bug was fixed, it was able to "catch" a scope's laser even though the player was already with his license revoked, reducing the time he had to wait for it to be given back;

[*]We corrected several typos on the "How to Play" screen and made some statements easier to understand;

[*]Objectives' arrows are now shown on the color of the player who's aiming at it, making it easier to players see if they have an objective at a certain location when multiple players are aiming at the same spot;

[*]The "Report Bug" option was also taken off the Main Menu;

[*]The Objectives counter now fade away instead of just disappearing when the player released the "Interaction" button while playing;
[/olist]

[h1]Wishlist: ːsteamboredː[/h1]
[list]
[*] Online Mode;
[*] More Spy Academy Levels;
[*] New Local Multiplayer modes;
[*] New Parties (Stages);
[*] New Spies;
[*] No more bugs!
[/list]

[url=http://gfactorygames.com]Glitch Factory Team.[/url]

